msgid ""
"Learn how to get involved with the Qiskit open-source community to shape the"
" future of quantum computing."
msgstr ""
"Pelajari cara berkontribusi dalam komunitas open-source Qiskit untuk "
"membentuk masa depan komputasi kuantum."

